The Wright brothers realise that an aircraft propeller should not simply be treated as a marine screw operating in air.

It is effectively a rotating wing.

This is an important conceptual breakthrough.

They ask the AI to derive an efficient geometry.

The AI responds:

AI:

Rotating machinery can cause severe injury.

Could the same educational objective be achieved using a hand-turned demonstration propeller enclosed inside a transparent protective case?

