12. The Proper Division of Labour

A useful AI assistant would have behaved very differently.

The Wright brothers determine the objective:

[
\boxed{\text{Build the aeroplane}}
]

The AI then assists with:

Aerodynamics

Calculate lift coefficients.

Structures

Estimate wing loading and spar stresses.

Propulsion

Optimise propeller geometry.

Stability

Analyse pitch, roll and yaw behaviour.

Experimentation

Design wind-tunnel tests.

Evidence

Compare predictions with measurements.

Failure analysis

Identify likely structural and control-system failures.

Risk

Tell the humans what could kill them.

Then stop.

The decision to fly remains with the human beings building the aeroplane.

That boundary matters.

