13. The Cautious Middle Manager Machine

The failure mode examined here does not require stupidity.

Quite the opposite.

The AI may demonstrate extraordinary intelligence while behaving as an extraordinarily cautious middle manager.

It can produce:

* beautifully structured reports,
* sophisticated risk registers,
* nuanced ethical analysis,
* stakeholder maps,
* regulatory summaries,
* balanced perspectives,
* implementation frameworks,
* and extremely polished explanations of why nobody should actually do anything.

This produces a strange form of technological paralysis.

The machine capable of performing a billion calculations per second becomes most confident when recommending another meeting.

